<title>JAPAN: Shinko Wire - 96/97 group results.</title>
<headline>Shinko Wire - 96/97 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 27.45		vs	   28.61</p>
<p> Operating	  450    million	  vs	    1.28</p>
<p> Current	    441    million	  vs	    1.23</p>
<p> Net	   loss 433    million	  vs	prft 450 million</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 7.38 yen	  vs     prft 7.77 yen</p>
<p> Diluted EPS   loss 5.07 yen	  vs     prft 7.13 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Shinko Wire Co Ltd is a leading processing firm for secondary steel products.</p>
